  "short_description": "<p>Handcrafted from natural bamboo and finished with a vibrant red lacquer, this spun bamboo bowl is lightweight, durable, and eco-friendly. Perfect for serving, decorating, or gifting, it brings a warm, modern touch to any living space.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"415\">Bring a touch of Vietnamese craftsmanship and vibrant color into your home with our <strong data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"348\">Red Spun Bamboo Bowl</strong> — a perfect blend of tradition, sustainability, and modern design.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"456\"><strong data-start=\"421\" data-end=\"456\">Handcrafted by Skilled Artisans</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"457\" data-end=\"714\">Each bowl is meticulously hand-crafted by Vietnamese artisans using traditional spinning techniques. Layers of natural bamboo are shaped, smoothed, and finished with a striking red lacquer, creating a product that is both lightweight and incredibly durable.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"744\"><strong data-start=\"720\" data-end=\"744\">A Sustainable Choice</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"984\">Bamboo is a fast-renewing natural material, making this bowl an eco-friendly alternative to conventional homewares. By choosing this item, you support rural artisan communities and help preserve Vietnam’s long-standing handicraft heritage.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"986\" data-end=\"1024\"><strong data-start=\"990\" data-end=\"1024\">Modern, Elegant, and Versatile</strong></h3>\n<p data-start=\"1025\" data-end=\"1093\">The bold red finish brings warmth and style to any space. Use it as:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1223\">\n<li data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1132\">\n<p data-start=\"1096\" data-end=\"1132\">A serving bowl for fruit or snacks</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1133\" data-end=\"1183\">\n<p data-start=\"1135\" data-end=\"1183\">A decorative centerpiece on tables and shelves</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1184\" data-end=\"1223\">\n<p data-start=\"1186\" data-end=\"1223\">A unique gift for home décor lovers</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1328\">Its smooth surface and eye-catching color make it suitable for both everyday use and festive occasions.</p>\n<h3 data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1356\"><strong data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1356\">Why You’ll Love It</strong></h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1536\">\n<li data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1377\">\n<p data-start=\"1359\" data-end=\"1377\">100% handcrafted</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1378\" data-end=\"1419\">\n<p data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1419\">Made from natural, sustainable bamboo</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1460\">\n<p data-start=\"1422\" data-end=\"1460\">Modern lacquer finish in vibrant red</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1488\">\n<p data-start=\"1463\" data-end=\"1488\">Lightweight yet durable</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1536\">\n<p data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1536\">Beautiful décor and practical functionality</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1538\" data-end=\"1625\">Add a splash of color and craftsmanship to your home with our <strong data-start=\"1600\" data-end=\"1624\">Red Spun Bamboo Bowl</strong>.</p>",
